# Play test of Scrapyard Haven (CIPlay scrapyard_haven, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the pier in
# the bay (2.6 m), the town on its terrace (5 m) inside the caravan ring, the gate at its south-west, the scrap pit below
# the ridge (5.5 m), the fortress's deck on the west ridge (18.7 m). The quest's 21 steps: the harbour, its notice, the
# wreck, the fisherman's tally, the lockbox and the gate key; the square, the market and its barrel, the tithe pile, the
# trader's van, the watchtower; the gate, the pit's edge, the pit, the hyenas, the scrapper's note, the pit's sign; the
# stilts, the fortress, the hoard.
island Scrapyard Haven
expect step 0
expect title King of the Scrapyard

# Up the quay's ladder from the sea, along it into the harbour: the notice, the wreck and the dinghy, the harbour
# master's lockbox (the gate key counted at once)
climb 43.1 25 h=-1
walk 40 25 to 27 25 to 23 24 h=5
zone harbour
expect step 1
read Harbour notice
expect step 2
zone wreck
expect step 3
read Fisherman's tally
expect step 4
open Harbour master's lockbox
expect story gatekey 1
expect step 6

# Round the town inside the wall: the square, the market and its barrel, the tithe pile, the trader's van, the tower
zone square
expect step 7
zone market
expect step 8
open Market barrel
expect step 9
read King's tithe pile
expect step 10
read Trader's price list
expect step 11
zone lookout
expect step 12

# The gate: shut until the winch hoists it
walk 9.5 21 to 3.8 19.8 to -1 14 h=4.5 blocked
use winch
expect message rises on its chains
wait 5
expect stand -1 14 h=3.6
expect stand 1.4 16.9 h=4.4
walk 9.5 21 to 3.8 19.8 to -1 14 h=3.6
zone gate
expect step 13

# Down the shore to the scrap pit: the hyena pack and its alpha
walk -1 14 to -4 9 to -8 -5 to -10 -20 to -9 -31 h=5.5
zone pitedge
expect step 14
zone pit
expect step 15
expect message collar of bolts
kill Hyena
expect step 16
expect animals Hyena 0
read Scrapper's note
expect step 17
read King's pit sign
expect step 18

# Up the ladders to the scrap king's fortress: the hoard on its deck
zone stilts
expect step 19
climb -14.6 -10 h=9.1
climb -14.6 -10 h=13
expect stand -18.5 -10 h=18.7
zone fortress
expect step 20
open Scrap king's hoard
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_ZiplineBase 1
expect done
